    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_class1d_eve09",
      "hash64": "E309C8AF3BF5C3B9",
      "text": "比起寶可夢對戰，\\n我更喜歡照顧寶可夢。\\c\\n用寶可夢洗澡澡幫牠們洗澡，\\n連我都會感覺受到療癒了～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_class1d_eve10",
      "hash64": "E30D55AF3BF8E927",
      "text": "既有像帕奇利茲一樣\\n不會進化的寶可夢，\\c\\n也有像伊布一樣\\n有很多種進化的寶可夢喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_class1d_eve11",
      "hash64": "E30D54AF3BF8E774",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
